.860" end="02:03.190">our </span><span begin="02:03.190" end="02:04.180">lives</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.180" end="02:07.720"><span begin="02:04.180" end="02:04.720">We </span><span begin="02:04.720" end="02:05.110">were </span><span begin="02:05.110" end="02:05.920">born </span><span begin="02:05.920" end="02:06.370">and </span><span begin="02:06.370" end="02:07.720">raised</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.020" end="02:11.320"><span begin="02:08.020" end="02:08.320">In </span><span begin="02:08.320" end="02:09.220">a </span><span begin="02:09.220" end="02:10.240">summer </span><span begin="02:10.240" end="02:11.320">haze</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.320" end="02:14.590"><span begin="02:11.320" end="02:12.190">Bound </span><span begin="02:12.190" end="02:12.970">by </span><span begin="02:12.970" end="02:13.330">the </span><span begin="02:13.330" end="02:14.590">surprise</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.950" end="02:19.240"><span begin="02:14.950" end="02:15.430">Of </span><span begin="02:15.430" end="02:15.790">our </span><span begin="02:15.790" end="02:17.590">glory </span><span begin="02:17.590" end="02:19.240">days</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.240" end="02:22.480"><span begin="02:19.240" end="02:19.330">I </span><span begin="02:19.330" end="02:19.600">hate </span><span begin="02:19.600" end="02:19.750">to </span><span begin="02:19.750" end="02:20.170">turn </span><span begin="02:20.170" end="02:20.560">up </span><span begin="02:20.560" end="02:20.800">out </span><span begin="02:20.800" end="02:20.980">of </span><span begin="02:20.980" end="02:21.100">the </span><span begin="02:21.100" end="02:21.700">blue </span><span begin="02:21.700" end="02:22.480">uninvited</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.510" end="02:26.140"><span begin="02:22.510" end="02:22.750">But </span><span begin="02:22.750" end="02:23.350">I </span><span begin="02:23.350" end="02:23.710">couldn't </span><span begin="02:23.710" end="02:24